                <zone fixed-size='192' h='22222' id='11' is-fixed='true' name='funnel chart' show-title='false' w='98858' x='571' y='28778'>
                  <layout-cache type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='33778' id='14' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='51000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Key Insights</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>- The site generated 1.76M sessions from 1.4M unique visitors, resulting</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  in just 14.3K purchases — a 0.81% overall conversion rate.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>- The primary constraint is not traffic, but progression through the</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  funnel: only 2.5% of sessions that view a product ever add it to</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  cart — the single largest point of loss in the customer journey.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>- Cart abandonment (72.8%) is a secondary factor, affecting a much</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  smaller pool of already-engaged sessions than the view-to-cart</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  drop-off does.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>- The following dashboards examine the behavioral drivers behind this</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  gap and identify which product categories offer the greatest</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>  opportunity for improvement.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{626C117F-D077-4730-B66E-806DB472CD48}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Product Category Performance'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1400' minheight='900' minwidth='1400' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='17000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98858' x='571' y='82111'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11445' id='16' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='82111'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Insights</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Category 429</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> represents the largest optimization opportunity, with an estimated </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>227 additional carts</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> if its View→Cart conversion matched the benchmark.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Opportunity is </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>highly concentrated rather than evenly distributed</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. Just </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>102 categories (19.1% of eligible categories)</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> account for </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>80% of the total addressable opportunity</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, enabling focused optimization instead of site-wide changes.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• The largest performance gaps occur </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>before products reach the cart</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. Most opportunity comes from improving </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>View→Cart conversion</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, while </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Cart→Purchase performance is comparatively stable</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> across categories.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recommendation:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Prioritize the highest-opportunity categories for targeted experimentation. Based on the behavioral findings from Dashboard 2, test improvements that encourage </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>product discovery, richer product information, comparison features, and stronger trust signals</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> to increase add-to-cart rates.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5778' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='889'>
